[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
We intentionally got off the taxi just outside the condominium.[p]
At the same time, the men standing outside the building pointed their cameras at us.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[stopse  time="3000"  buf="0"  fadeout="true"  ]
[bg  time="4000"  method="crossfade"  storage="back_mansyonmae_yoru.jpg"  ]
[playbgm  volume="100"  time="1000"  loop="true"  storage="ryoujyoku2.mp3"  ]
[playse  volume="50"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="com22.mp3"  loop="true"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
(Exactly the response I expected... Feels good man...)[p]

I checked the news article on my phone again.[p]
"Popular anchor Hiiragi Yume discovered and admits to living with a man"[p]

(It was just yesterday, and already paparazzi and reporters are already staking us out.)[p]
Reporter "Ms. Yume, do you have a moment?!"[p]
#由芽
Yume "........."[p]

Yume remained silent and clung to my arm.[p]
Immediately, a barrage of camera shutter sounds engulfed us.[p]

(Oh man... This is turning into a full blown scandal. And my photo's gonna be in it too.)[p]

#由芽
Yume "Shinya,what do we do?"[p]
Shinya "Let them be. Wave to the cameras even, so you can look cute in the pictures."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Okay..."[p]

With a dazed look, she smiled and waved lightly.[p]
In the midst of the blinding camera flashes, we walked forth.[p]

Reporter "Ms. Yume, a word from you please!"[p]
Shinya "Why not answer them?"[p]
Reporter "Who is that man with--"[p]
#由芽
Yume "He's my boyfriend. He's very dear to me."[p]
#由芽
Yume "It's thanks to him that I became who I am today. I discovered a whole new kind of happiness."[p]
#由芽
Yume "He's the only one for me."[p]
Reporter "So you're saying you have plans to marry?"[p]
Shinya "You can answer that too, Yume."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Of course. We plan to marry."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Rather, I just want to stay by his side forever and ever."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Because that brings me happiness."[p]
Reporter "Um, there have been remarks regarding your strange behavior..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Don't be silly. Everyday has just been so wonderful that maybe my face has gotten tired from smiling."[p]

Despite her blank eyes, her sharp responses left even the seasoned reporters flabbergasted.[p]
The paparazzi were desperate to capture even that scene.[p]

#由芽
Yume "Please, take all the photos you want. I'm so happy."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Shinya, these are couples photos of us."[p]
Shinya "Yeah, they sure are."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Fufu, this is wonderful. My heart is racing and I feel so hot."[p]
Shinya "Really? Care to go into detail?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Ngh... I'm so wet... Every time they take a photo, I tighten up down there."[p]
Shinya "I see. As a parting gift, why don't you let them take a photo of your true self then?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Can I?"[p]
Shinya "Sure. Make sure they get your good side."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I will."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[stopse  time="1000"  buf="2"  fadeout="true"  ]
[mask  time="1000"  effect="fadeIn"  color="0x000000"  ]
