[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Yume took one step forward and pulled her skirt up.[p]
Immediately, the crowd erupted in screams.[p]

Reporter "What the--?!"[p]
Cameraman "Hey, can we take a photo of this?!"[p]
Reporter "Just take one in case!"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Make sure to get a good photo."[p]

Yume flashed them a bright smile with a vibrator jammed up her crotch.[p]
Her love juices trailed down her legs and dripped to the ground.[p]

(What a thrill... seeing all them appalled.)[p]
Cameraman "What the hell... And I used to be your fan too."[p]
Reporter "We're on the job here!"[p]

As bewilderment filled the mob, I gave Yume a little push from the back.[p]

Shinya "That should be enough. Let's go Yume."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Okay..."[p]
Reporter "Wait! Yume, are you being forced to do this?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Of course not. At first, I was happy to because Shinya enjoyed it..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "But now I do it because I like it, and it feels good too."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I believe I found the most wonderful partner for me."[p]

[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="5000"  method="crossfade"  storage="black.jpg"  ]
[stopbgm  time="2000"  fadeout="true"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
I savored this feeling of triumph as Yume and I made our way back to my room.[p]
Just imagining all the ways we would make love and surrender ourselves to lust made me immeasurably aroused.[p]

(She is mine, and mine alone!)[p]

Shinya "Yume, good job back there."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Thank you... I love you Shinya."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

